    {
      "day": "Mahalaya",
      "html": "<div class=\"rounded-[11px] sm:rounded-[15px] bg-[#FFFBF0] text-[#2C1210] p-3.5 sm:p-5 space-y-2.5 border border-white/60\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-[#E5C880]/60 pb-2.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\" style=\"background-color:#D97706\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M173.79,51.48a221.25,221.25,0,0,0-41.67-34.34,8,8,0,0,0-8.24,0A221.25,221.25,0,0,0,82.21,51.48C54.59,80.48,40,112.47,40,144a88,88,0,0,0,176,0C216,112.47,201.41,80.48,173.79,51.48ZM96,184c0-27.67,22.53-47.28,32-54.3,9.48,7,32,26.63,32,54.3a32,32,0,0,1-64,0Z\"></path></svg></div><div><span class=\"text-[9px] font-mono font-bold uppercase text-[#B45309] block\">Dawn Awakening • 4:00 AM</span><h3 class=\"font-serif font-black text-base sm:text-lg text-[#2C1210]\">Mahalaya: The Celestial Reawakening</h3></div></div><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-[#B45309] font-mono font-bold text-[10px] border border-amber-500/30\">Dawn Chandi Path &amp; Chokkhudaan</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-3 items-center\"><div class=\"md:col-span-8\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#2C1210]/85 font-serif leading-relaxed\">At 4:00 AM, millions across Bengal awaken to the legendary radio recitation of 'Mahishasuramardini' by Birendra Krishna Bhadra. Artisans paint Devi Durga's third eye, marking the descent of the Divine Mother.</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-4 bg-[#FFF5E0] rounded-lg p-2.5 border border-[#E5C880]/60 text-left\"><span class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono font-bold text-[#D90429] block\">Sacred Ritual Offering</span><p class=\"text-[11px] font-serif font-bold text-[#2C1210] mt-0.5\">Tarpan, Chandi Path &amp; Sacred Dawn Invocation</p></div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "day": "Maha Shasthi",
      "html": "<div class=\"rounded-[11px] sm:rounded-[15px] bg-[#FFFBF0] text-[#2C1210] p-3.5 sm:p-5 space-y-2.5 border border-white/60\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-[#E5C880]/60 pb-2.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\" style=\"background-color:#059669\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M210.35,129.36c-.81-.47-1.7-.92-2.62-1.36.92-.44,1.81-.89,2.62-1.36a40,40,0,1,0-40-69.28c-.81.47-1.65,1-2.48,1.59.08-1,.13-2,.13-3a40,40,0,0,0-80,0c0,.94,0,1.94.13,3-.83-.57-1.67-1.12-2.48-1.59a40,40,0,1,0-40,69.28c.81.47,1.7.92,2.62,1.36-.92.44-1.81.89-2.62,1.36a40,40,0,1,0,40,69.28c.81-.47,1.65-1,2.48-1.59-.08,1-.13,2-.13,2.95a40,40,0,0,0,80,0c0-.94-.05-1.94-.13-2.95.83.57,1.67,1.12,2.48,1.59A39.79,39.79,0,0,0,190.29,204a40.43,40.43,0,0,0,10.42-1.38,40,40,0,0,0,9.64-73.28ZM128,156a28,28,0,1,1,28-28A28,28,0,0,1,128,156Z\"></path></svg></div><div><span class=\"text-[9px] font-mono font-bold uppercase text-[#B45309] block\">Pandal Inauguration • Evening</span><h3 class=\"font-serif font-black text-base sm:text-lg text-[#2C1210]\">Maha Shasthi: Bodhon &amp; Sacred Unveiling</h3></div></div><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-[#B45309] font-mono font-bold text-[10px] border border-amber-500/30\">Welcoming Devi Under the Bilva Tree</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-3 items-center\"><div class=\"md:col-span-8\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#2C1210]/85 font-serif leading-relaxed\">The ritual of Bodhon awakens the deity with chanting and drumbeats beneath a sacred Bel tree. Pandals across Kolkata throw open their ornate gates as the city is bathed in festive fervour.</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-4 bg-[#FFF5E0] rounded-lg p-2.5 border border-[#E5C880]/60 text-left\"><span class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono font-bold text-[#D90429] block\">Sacred Ritual Offering</span><p class=\"text-[11px] font-serif font-bold text-[#2C1210] mt-0.5\">Amantran, Adhivas &amp; Bilva Tree Bodhon</p></div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "day": "Maha Saptami",
      "html": "<div class=\"rounded-[11px] sm:rounded-[15px] bg-[#FFFBF0] text-[#2C1210] p-3.5 sm:p-5 space-y-2.5 border border-white/60\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-[#E5C880]/60 pb-2.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\" style=\"background-color:#0284C7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M220.8,169.6A8,8,0,0,0,216,168h-8V64a32,32,0,0,0-32-32H40A32,32,0,0,0,8,64C8,77.61,18.05,85.54,19.2,86.4h0A7.89,7.89,0,0,0,24,88a8,8,0,0,0,4.87-14.33h0C28.83,73.62,24,69.74,24,64a16,16,0,0,1,32,0V192a32,32,0,0,0,32,32H200a32,32,0,0,0,32-32C232,178.39,222,170.46,220.8,169.6ZM104,96h64a8,8,0,0,1,0,16H104a8,8,0,0,1,0-16Zm-8,40a8,8,0,0,1,8-8h64a8,8,0,0,1,0,16H104A8,8,0,0,1,96,136Zm104,72H107.71A31.82,31.82,0,0,0,112,192a26.92,26.92,0,0,0-1.21-8h102a12.58,12.58,0,0,1,3.23,8A16,16,0,0,1,200,208Z\"></path></svg></div><div><span class=\"text-[9px] font-mono font-bold uppercase text-[#B45309] block\">River Rituals • Dawn</span><h3 class=\"font-serif font-black text-base sm:text-lg text-[#2C1210]\">Maha Saptami: Nabapatrika Snan</h3></div></div><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-[#B45309] font-mono font-bold text-[10px] border border-amber-500/30\">The Sacred Nine Plant River Bath</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-3 items-center\"><div class=\"md:col-span-8\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#2C1210]/85 font-serif leading-relaxed\">Before sunrise, the Nabapatrika ('Kola Bou' draped in a red-bordered yellow saree) is ritually bathed in the sacred river Hooghly, invoking nature's life-giving feminine powers.</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-4 bg-[#FFF5E0] rounded-lg p-2.5 border border-[#E5C880]/60 text-left\"><span class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono font-bold text-[#D90429] block\">Sacred Ritual Offering</span><p class=\"text-[11px] font-serif font-bold text-[#2C1210] mt-0.5\">Nabapatrika Holy Bath &amp; Pran Pratishtha</p></div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "day": "Maha Ashtami",
      "html": "<div class=\"rounded-[11px] sm:rounded-[15px] bg-[#FFFBF0] text-[#2C1210] p-3.5 sm:p-5 space-y-2.5 border border-white/60\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-[#E5C880]/60 pb-2.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\" style=\"background-color:#D90429\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M248,80a28,28,0,1,0-51.12,15.77l-26.79,33L146,73.4a28,28,0,1,0-36.06,0L85.91,128.74l-26.79-33a28,28,0,1,0-26.6,12L47,194.63A16,16,0,0,0,62.78,208H193.22A16,16,0,0,0,209,194.63l14.47-86.85A28,28,0,0,0,248,80ZM128,40a12,12,0,1,1-12,12A12,12,0,0,1,128,40ZM24,80A12,12,0,1,1,36,92,12,12,0,0,1,24,80ZM220,92a12,12,0,1,1,12-12A12,12,0,0,1,220,92Z\"></path></svg></div><div><span class=\"text-[9px] font-mono font-bold uppercase text-[#B45309] block\">Peak Sanctity • Midnight Junction</span><h3 class=\"font-serif font-black text-base sm:text-lg text-[#2C1210]\">Maha Ashtami: Kumari Puja &amp; Sandhi Puja</h3></div></div><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-[#B45309] font-mono font-bold text-[10px] border border-amber-500/30\">108 Lotus Offering &amp; Peak Divine Energy</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-3 items-center\"><div class=\"md:col-span-8\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#2C1210]/85 font-serif leading-relaxed\">Young girls are worshipped as living incarnations of the Goddess in Kumari Puja. At the stroke of midnight during Sandhi Puja (the junction of Ashtami and Navami), 108 blue lotuses and 108 oil lamps are offered in 24 minutes.</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-4 bg-[#FFF5E0] rounded-lg p-2.5 border border-[#E5C880]/60 text-left\"><span class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono font-bold text-[#D90429] block\">Sacred Ritual Offering</span><p class=\"text-[11px] font-serif font-bold text-[#2C1210] mt-0.5\">108 Blue Lotuses, 108 Diyas &amp; Kumari Aradhana</p></div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "day": "Maha Navami",
      "html": "<div class=\"rounded-[11px] sm:rounded-[15px] bg-[#FFFBF0] text-[#2C1210] p-3.5 sm:p-5 space-y-2.5 border border-white/60\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-[#E5C880]/60 pb-2.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\" style=\"background-color:#7C3AED\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M210.3,56.34l-80-24A8,8,0,0,0,120,40V148.26A48,48,0,1,0,136,184V98.75l69.7,20.91A8,8,0,0,0,216,112V64A8,8,0,0,0,210.3,56.34Z\"></path></svg></div><div><span class=\"text-[9px] font-mono font-bold uppercase text-[#B45309] block\">Rhythmic Dance • Evening</span><h3 class=\"font-serif font-black text-base sm:text-lg text-[#2C1210]\">Maha Navami: Maha Arati &amp; Dhunuchi Naach</h3></div></div><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-[#B45309] font-mono font-bold text-[10px] border border-amber-500/30\">Frenzied Drumbeats &amp; Frankincense Rhythms</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-3 items-center\"><div class=\"md:col-span-8\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#2C1210]/85 font-serif leading-relaxed\">The pinnacle of rhythmic ecstasy. Revelers balance burning clay pots of coconut husk and fragrant camphor (Dhunuchi) with bare hands and teeth, dancing frantically to the booming tempo of the Dhak.</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-4 bg-[#FFF5E0] rounded-lg p-2.5 border border-[#E5C880]/60 text-left\"><span class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono font-bold text-[#D90429] block\">Sacred Ritual Offering</span><p class=\"text-[11px] font-serif font-bold text-[#2C1210] mt-0.5\">Maha Bhog, Maha Arati &amp; Dhunuchi Nritya</p></div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "day": "Bijoya Dashami",
      "html": "<div class=\"rounded-[11px] sm:rounded-[15px] bg-[#FFFBF0] text-[#2C1210] p-3.5 sm:p-5 space-y-2.5 border border-white/60\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-[#E5C880]/60 pb-2.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\" style=\"background-color:#E11D48\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M240,102c0,70-103.79,126.66-108.21,129a8,8,0,0,1-7.58,0C119.79,228.66,16,172,16,102A62.07,62.07,0,0,1,78,40c20.65,0,38.73,8.88,50,23.89C139.27,48.88,157.35,40,178,40A62.07,62.07,0,0,1,240,102Z\"></path></svg></div><div><span class=\"text-[9px] font-mono font-bold uppercase text-[#B45309] block\">Immersion Parade • Sunset to Midnight</span><h3 class=\"font-serif font-black text-base sm:text-lg text-[#2C1210]\">Bijoya Dashami: Sindoor Khela &amp; Immersion</h3></div></div><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-[#B45309] font-mono font-bold text-[10px] border border-amber-500/30\">Emotional Farewell &amp; Red Road Carnival</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-3 items-center\"><div class=\"md:col-span-8\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#2C1210]/85 font-serif leading-relaxed\">Married women smear bright vermilion on the Goddess and each other in Sindoor Khela. The idols are carried in grand torchlit processions to the river ghats amidst the collective chant: 'Asche Bochor Abar Hobe!'</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-4 bg-[#FFF5E0] rounded-lg p-2.5 border border-[#E5C880]/60 text-left\"><span class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono font-bold text-[#D90429] block\">Sacred Ritual Offering</span><p class=\"text-[11px] font-serif font-bold text-[#2C1210] mt-0.5\">Sindoor Khela, Darpan Bisharjan &amp; Shanti Jal</p></div></div></div>"
    }
  ]
}
